* Week 9 topology-only semiconductor baseline
* Project-authored wrapper; it copies no vendor model parameters.
* This file intentionally invokes ngspice's built-in default device parameters.
* It is useful for connectivity and harness smoke tests only. It is not a
* historical-device model, a realistic prediction model, or a build claim.

.model W09_NPN_BASE NPN
.model W09_PNP_BASE PNP
.model W09_NJF_BASE NJF
.model W09_D_BASE D

